<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>WhatsApp</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
body{background:#111b21;display:flex;justify-content:center;height:100vh}
.app{width:100%;max-width:480px;background:#efeae2;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.header{background:#075e54;color:#fff;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.header h2{font-size:20px}
.header span{font-size:22px}
.tabs{background:#075e54;color:#fff;display:flex;padding-bottom:8px}
.tabs div{flex:1;text-align:center;padding:8px;font-size:14px;opacity:.7}
.tabs div.active{opacity:1;border-bottom:3px solid #fff;font-weight:bold}
.search{background:#fff;margin:8px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:#888;font-size:14px}
.chat{background:#fff;padding:12px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;cursor:pointer}
.chat img{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover}
.chat-info{flex:1}
.chat-info b{font-size:16px}
.chat-info p{color:#888;font-size:13px;margin-top:3px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:220px}
.time{font-size:11px;color:#25d366;text-align:left}
.time span{display:block;background:#25d366;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;width:20px;height:20px;text-align:center;line-height:20px;margin:5px auto 0;font-size:11px}
.bottom{background:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:space-around;padding:12px;border-top:1px solid #ddd;color:#075e54;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
<div class="header"><h2>واتساب</h2><span>📷 🔍 ⋮</span></div>
<div class="tabs"><div>المجتمع</div><div class="active">الدردشات</div><div>التحديثات</div><div>المكالمات</div></div>
<div class="search">🔍 بحث...</div>

<div class="chat"><img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=12"><div class="chat-info"><b>أنس</b><p>هلا وينك؟ 😂</p></div><div class="time">10:45 <span>2</span></div></div>
<div class="chat"><img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=32"><div class="chat-info"><b>محمد</b><p>تمام بعتلك الملف</p></div><div class="time">09:12 <span>1</span></div></div>
<div class="chat"><img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=5"><div class="chat-info"><b>العيلة ❤️</b><p>أمي: مين جاي اليوم؟</p></div><div class="time">أمس</div></div>
<div class="chat"><img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=47"><div class="chat-info"><b>أحمد</b><p>✅✅</p></div><div class="time">أمس</div></div>
<div class="chat"><img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/100?img=8"><div class="chat-info"><b>شغل</b><p>الاجتماع بكرة 10</p></div><div class="time">الثلاثاء</div></div>

<div style="flex:1"></div>
<div class="bottom"><span>الدردشات</span><span>التحديثات</span><span>المجتمع</span><span>المكالمات</span></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>

